# Hugo's build output and its lock file. The site is built from source on
# every deploy; nothing generated belongs in the history.
public/
.hugo_build.lock

# make casts renders these fresh from docs/tapes/ into the scratch dir and
# copies them here; committing them would mean a growing pile of binaries in
# git for something a make target regenerates deterministically enough.
# static/posters/ is deliberately NOT ignored: posters are lightweight stills
# committed to git so the unversioned main-tracking root can paint its hero
# poster before and between release tags, while the heavier mp4/webm video
# binaries render only on tags.
static/casts/
